 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"16\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.393em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2218\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, we have </p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"17\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 9.66em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0.139em; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2218\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"3\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2218\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><m