      "worked_solution": "Since the sum of the measures of the interior angles of a triangle is ${180}^{∘}$, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{60}^{∘}+x+(x+{10}^{∘}) & ={180}^{∘} \\\\ {70}^{∘}+2x & ={180}^{∘} \\\\ 2x & ={110}^{∘} \\\\ x & ={55}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
